<title>USA: Unisys awarded NASA workstation contract.</title>
<headline>Unisys awarded NASA workstation contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Wednesday its Federal Systems Division received a contract to provide general purpose workstations to the National Aeronautics and Space Administration and other U.S. agencies.</p>
<p>The contract, which does not specify quantity or delivery times, has an estimated value to Unisys of $50 million, it said.</p>
<p>Unisys received $70 million in orders in an initial NASA worstation program, it said.</p>
